NeoSCAD patch to clipper2-rust 1.2.0 (crates.io): two sweep shortcuts
with identical output. build_intersect_list skips its merge sort when no
active edge moved left of its neighbour at the top of the scanbeam (the
sort would find no intersection), and do_top_of_scanbeam then skips
recomputing top_x for edges whose curr_x already holds it. In a union of
many disjoint outlines (200 lines of text) the sort was 39% of the run.

Upstream: not yet filed; a draft issue is in vendor/README.md ("Upstream
drafts").

Apply from the crate root on top of 0001: patch -p1 < this file.
See vendor/README.md ("The sweep shortcuts").

